{
  "$schema": "./sources.schema.md",
  "_comment": [
    "OreScout per-state source registry (PROJECT_PLAN.md §6.13). SINGLE SOURCE OF TRUTH for",
    "which data sources exist per state and every per-state parameter. The 🔒 invariant:",
    "adding a state = ONE entry here (+ a classifier mapping only for a genuinely new attribute",
    "vocabulary). The engine, tiles, and UI never change. See etl/sources.schema.md for the field",
    "spec and docs/ADD_A_STATE.md for the runbook. Read by scripts/etl/registry_lib.sh (jq).",
    "Values transcribed verbatim from the scripts they replaced; scripts/test/registry_roundtrip.sh",
    "proves the transcription is faithful."
